1. TIERS
   Your rights depend on the license key issued to you (enforced at runtime;
   see license.mjs). Current prices and purchase links are in PRICING.md.

   (a) Free Gate ($0) — exactly 25 keys issued globally, first-come.
       Non-commercial use, evaluation, and open-source projects with
       attribution. 100,000 compress/decompress calls per calendar month,
       max 10,000 ints per call. No livestream/chunked commercial use.
       No SaaS resale of the codec. Community support only.

   (b) Starting Gate ($79 one-time) — 1 commercial product.
       5,000,000 calls/month, max 100,000 ints per call. No livestream.
       Best-effort email support (72h).

   (c) Pro Starter ($249 one-time) — 5 commercial products.
       50,000,000 calls/month, max 1,000,000 ints per call. Livestream /
       chunked encoding included. Email support (24-48h).

   (d) l33t Unlimited ($699 one-time) — unlimited products, calls, and
       ints per call. Livestream included. You may ship the minified
       runtime compiled inside your own products. Priority support.

   A call is one compress OR decompress invocation. Unpaid / invalid keys
   fall back to Free Gate limits where the free pool is not exhausted.

